#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "Who made this game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The kdegames team. You can find their website <ulink url=\"http://games.kde."
"org\">here</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I get cheatcodes?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "You cannot get cheatcodes for &kde; games."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can start a new game using the <guibutton>New</guibutton> button on the "
"toolbar, the <menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu entry on the menubar or using the default "
"shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I pause the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kolorlines; does not have this feature as it is not required."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To change &kolorlines; visual theme you can use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kolorlines;..."
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To undo a move you can use a <link linkend=\"menu-move-undo\">keyboard "
"shortcut</link>, or a <link linkend=\"menu-move-undo\">menubar option.</link>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid "I don't want to make any moves right now. Can I skip a turn?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To skip a turn you can use a <link linkend=\"menu-move-endturn"
"\">keyboard shortcut</link>, or a <link linkend=\"menu-move-endturn"
"\">menubar</link> option."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kolorlines; cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kolorlines; does not have a <quote>Hint</quote> feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kolorlines; does not have a <quote>Save</quote> feature at this moment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are the high scores?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the high scores simply use <link linkend=\"menu-game-highscore"
"\"><guimenuitem>Show High Scores...</guimenuitem></link> option on the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the game configuration. Where do I go?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the game configuration you can use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kolorlines;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"option on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:330
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kolorlines; configuration dialog allows you to select &kolorlines; visual "
"themes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a new theme simply choose the theme's name from the selection list."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For your convenience a quick preview screenshot will be displayed on the "
"right hand sided of the selection list as soon as you select the theme "
"you're interested in."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with the theme you have selected you can either click "
"<guibutton>Apply</guibutton>, or simply click <guibutton>Ok</guibutton> "
"button, located at the bottom part of this dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If, however you are dissatisfied with your selection – simply click "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> to discard the changes."
msgstr ""

